  "description": "A recording from StockTok 📈's live video",
  "body_html": "<p>Thanks for everyone that tuned in last night!</p><ul><li><p>FOMC and Interest Rates review</p></li><li><p>17:50 - S&amp;P 500 Review</p></li><li><p>24:30 - Tickers of interest: MP, PCT, JBL</p></li><li><p>33:41 - Nvidia </p></li><li><p>40:18 - COIN, PLNT, MVST, NBIS, TMC, LCID, TSSI, SEZL, BKTI</p></li></ul><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Thank you <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ok, Hold My Beer&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:307902955,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://substack.com/@thanatos369&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6391e198-8baf-4b8f-9179-b9a03d954afe_1167x969.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d8590952-1101-4a82-bb46-4f58313d6b65&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Bailey Marshall&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:301761106,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://substack.com/@bailey21&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fd2e9924-8c11-4a34-b95a-c42fbd645fe6_144x144.png&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;747e1ab0-d7ae-4653-a41a-95bdb171d1c8&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Cristian&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:321284655,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://substack.com/@crys74&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:null,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;be890069-6e02-4a46-bcf2-65e2e30c1b02&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Dan&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:306501427,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://substack.com/@4flechas&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fe71e6a0-54ca-4c91-982a-35f02bce6998_1043x1043.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d16a50e2-3977-4ca1-8a9d-32cfe294f5d0&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Colin Barnhill&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:18431369,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://substack.com/@colinbarnhill&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:null,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;504032ce-bca6-4b73-9641-05689835a21a&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, and many others for tuning into my live video! Join me for my next live video in the app.</p><div class=\"install-substack-app-embed install-substack-app-embed-web\" data-component-name=\"InstallSubstackAppToDOM\"><img class=\"install-substack-app-embed-img\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLq1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96c222d2-04e7-4e47-9